"text":"Also, it might also be the effect of Lieutenant Albert's concern for us Dolls..."}]}],"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#10"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#10":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#10","act":10,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":146,"name":"Logistics Officer","rawName":"Logistics Officer","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"군수처 장관"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#10","rawText":"Anyway, that's not the issue. The important thing is, you've done a good job.","displayText":"Anyway, that's not the issue. The important thing is, you've done a good job.","spans":[{"text":"Anyway, that's not the issue. The important thing is, you've done a good job."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#11"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#11":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#11","act":11,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":146,"name":"Logistics Officer","rawName":"Logistics Officer","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"군수처 장관"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#11","rawText":"Oh forget it, why am I even explaining all this to a Doll... In any case, you did well, so keep it up.","displayText":"Oh forget it, why am I even explaining all this to a Doll... In any case, you did well, so keep it up.","spans":[{"text":"Oh forget it, why am I even explaining all this to a Doll... In any case, you did well, so keep it up."}]}],"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#12"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#12":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#12","act":12,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":1}],"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#12","rawText":"Thank you very much, sir.","displayText":"Thank you very much, sir.","spans":[{"text":"Thank you very much, sir."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}],"heroFace":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":1}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#13"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#13":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#13","act":13,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#13","rawText":"Centaureissi pauses. Upon hearing the officer talk about ambushes, her thoughts go to Clotho.","displayText":"Centaureissi pauses. Upon hearing the officer talk about ambushes, her thoughts go to Clotho.","spans":[{"text":"Centaureissi pauses. Upon hearing the officer talk about ambushes, her thoughts go to Clotho."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#14"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#14":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#14","act":14,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":2}],"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#14","rawText":"A question, if I may, sir.","displayText":"A question, if I may, sir.","spans":[{"text":"A question, if I may, sir."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}],"heroFace":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":2}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#15"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#15":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#15","act":15,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":146,"name":"Logistics Officer","rawName":"Logistics Officer","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"군수처 장관"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#15","rawText":"Go ahead.","displayText":"Go ahead.","spans":[{"text":"Go ahead."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#16"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#16":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#16","act":16,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#16","rawText":"May I ask how Clotho—that Doll who came with me—is doing?","displayText":"May I ask how Clotho—that Doll who came with me—is doing?","spans":[{"text":"May I ask how Clotho—that Doll who came with me—is doing?"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#17"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#17":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#17","act":17,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":0}],"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#17","rawText":"I heard she is very busy now since she has to take care of those \"sudden situations\", so she is rarely in the base...","displayText":"I heard she is very busy now since she has to take care of those \"sudden situations\", so she is rarely in the base...","spans":[{"text":"I heard she is very busy now since she has to take care of those \"sudden situations\", so she is rarely in the base..."}]}],"stageRaw":{"heroFace":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":0}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#18"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#18":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#18","act":18,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":146,"name":"Logistics Officer","rawName":"Logistics Officer","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"군수처 장관"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#18","rawText":"Her? Hm... Well, she's working.","displayText":"Her? Hm... Well, she's working.","spans":[{"text":"Her? Hm... Well, she's working."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#19"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#19":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#19","act":19,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":146,"name":"Logistics Officer","rawName":"Logistics Officer","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"군수처 장관"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#19","rawText":"Frankly speaking, anybody could do that job, so we're not really particular... I hope luck is on her side and she doesn't get shelled to bits.","displayText":"Frankly speaking, anybody could do that job, so we're not really particular... I hope luck is on her side and she doesn't get shelled to bits.","spans":[{"text":"Frankly speaking, anybody could do that job, so we're not really particular... I hope luck is on her side and she doesn't get shelled to bits."}]}],"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#20"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#20":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#20","act":20,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":146,"name":"Logistics Officer","rawName":"Logistics Officer","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"군수처 장관"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#20","rawText":"Right, you shouldn't be worrying so much about irrelevant things. Carry on with your work.","displayText":"Right, you shouldn't be worrying so much about irrelevant things. Carry on with your work.","spans":[{"text":"Right, you shouldn't be worrying so much about irrelevant things. Carry on with your work."}]}],"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#21"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#21":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#21","act":21,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#21","rawText":"Yes, sir.","displayText":"Yes, sir.","spans":[{"text":"Yes, sir."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#22"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#22":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#22","act":22,"kind":"direction","stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":146,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":true},{"imgId":1,"delay":0,"duration":0.6,"alpha":0}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#23"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#23":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#23","act":23,"kind":"scene","units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#23","rawText":"At the rest area.","displayText":"At the rest area.","spans":[{"text":"At the rest area."}]}],"stageRaw":{"images":[{"imgId":139,"imgType":3,"alpha":0,"imgPath":"centaureissi_mil_avg","delete":true},{"imgId":139,"imgType":3,"alpha":0,"imgPath":"centaureissi_avg"}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#24"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#24":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#24","act":24,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":147,"name":"Soldier A","rawName":"Soldier A","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"병사A"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#24","rawText":"Hey, look who it is! It's Base 27's Iron Maid!","displayText":"Hey, look who it is! It's Base 27's Iron Maid!","spans":[{"text":"Hey, look who it is! It's Base 27's Iron Maid!"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":2,"delay":0,"duration":0.6,"alpha":1},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":147,"delay":0.6,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":148,"delay":0,"duration":0,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":true},{"imgId":148,"delay":0.6,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#25"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#25":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#25","act":25,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":148,"name":"Soldier B","rawName":"Soldier B","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"병사B"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#25","rawText":"It's breaktime now, and the Lt.'s out, so you can't do anything to us now!","displayText":"It's breaktime now, and the Lt.'s out, so you can't do anything to us now!","spans":[{"text":"It's breaktime now, and the Lt.'s out, so you can't do anything to us now!"}],"shake":true}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":148,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#26"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#26":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#26","act":26,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":2,"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#26","rawText":"Excuse me, I need to clean this area.","displayText":"Excuse me, I need to clean this area.","spans":[{"text":"Excuse me, I need to clean this area."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":148,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":true},{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0,"posId":3,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":3,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#27"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#27":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#27","act":27,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":147,"name":"Soldier A","rawName":"Soldier A","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"병사A"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#27","rawText":"Tsk, as cold as ever...","displayText":"Tsk, as cold as ever...","spans":[{"text":"Tsk, as cold as ever..."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":139,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":3,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":true},{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#28"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#28":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#28","act":28,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":149,"name":"Soldier C","rawName":"Soldier C","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"병사C"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#28","rawText":"Forget it, Peter. You want her to hit you again? She sure opened our eyes last time!","displayText":"Forget it, Peter. You want her to hit you again? She sure opened our eyes last time!","spans":[{"text":"Forget it, Peter. You want her to hit you again? She sure opened our eyes last time!"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#29"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#29":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#29","act":29,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":147,"name":"Soldier A","rawName":"Soldier A","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"병사A"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#29","rawText":"Humph, I wonder who had all the free time to teach his Dolls how to fight...","displayText":"Humph, I wonder who had all the free time to teach his Dolls how to fight...","spans":[{"text":"Humph, I wonder who had all the free time to teach his Dolls how to fight..."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#30"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#30":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#30","act":30,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#30","rawText":"Even though they talk tough, the soldiers still obediently move aside and continue playing their little games.","displayText":"Even though they talk tough, the soldiers still obediently move aside and continue playing their little games.","spans":[{"text":"Even though they talk tough, the soldiers still obediently move aside and continue playing their little games."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":false},{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#31"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#31":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#31","act":31,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":149,"name":"Soldier C","rawName":"Soldier C","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"병사C"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#31","rawText":"Hah! You lose again, Peter!","displayText":"Hah! You lose again, Peter!","spans":[{"text":"Hah! You lose again, Peter!"}],"shake":true}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#32"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#32":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#32","act":32,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":147,"name":"Soldier A","rawName":"Soldier A","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"병사A"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#32","rawText":"Shut up! Again, let's go again!","displayText":"Shut up! Again, let's go again!","spans":[{"text":"Shut up! Again, let's go again!"}],"shake":true}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"shake":true,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#33"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#33":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#33","act":33,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"cpt_clotho_02_01#33","rawText":"They do somersaults as the music plays, and occasionally they roll around on the ground. It seems they are competing in physical abilities.","displayText":"They do somersaults as the music plays, and occasionally they roll around on the ground. It seems they are competing in physical abilities.","spans":[{"text":"They do somersaults as the music plays, and occasionally they roll around on the ground. It seems they are competing in physical abilities."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":149,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":0,"isDark":true},{"imgId":147,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":0,"isDark":false}]},"next":"cpt_clotho_02_01#34"},"cpt_clotho_02_01#34":{"id":"cpt_clotho_02_01#34","act":34,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1039,"name":"Centaureissi","rawName":"Centaureissi","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":139,"faceId":2}],"lookup":"센타우레이시"},"u